    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stepping out of the frame... that sounds so permanent. i keep thinking about it, and it feels like the only way to finally have control over anything is to just stop everything. like, if i'm gone, the expectations go away, the mask goes away, and i can finally just be still. it's the only way to actually win, isn't it? to just exit?",
